#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_social_b
msgid ""
"At least three years of consumer-related indicators—such as complaints,\n"
"                        recalls, satisfaction scores, service incidents, and "
"privacy breaches—are\n"
"                        maintained to identify trends, performance "
"improvements, and emerging risks."
msgstr ""
"苦情、\n"
"                        リコール、満足度スコア、サービスインシデント、プライ"
"バシー侵害など、消費者関連の指標を少なくとも3年間\n"
"                        保持し、傾向、パフォーマンスの改善、および新たなリス"
"クを特定します。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_governance_c
msgid ""
"At least three years of governance indicators; such as confirmed corruption/"
"bribery\n"
"                incidents, policy adoption rates, supplier compliance "
"scores, and training\n"
"                completion are maintained to track trends, performance "
"improvements, and emerging\n"
"                risks."
msgstr ""
"汚職・贈収賄の確認済みインシデント、方針の採用率、サプライヤーの遵守スコ"
"ア、\n"
"                研修の受講完了率などのガバナンス指標を少なくとも3年分維持"
"し、\n"
"                トレンド、パフォーマンス改善、新たなリスクの兆候を\n"
"                把握します。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_appendix_social_b
msgid ""
"At least three years of workforce indicators; such as headcount, turnover, "
"diversity,\n"
"                training hours, and safety rates, are maintained to identify "
"structural changes,\n"
"                performance improvements, or emerging risks."
msgstr ""
"従業員数、離職率、ダイバーシティ、\n"
"                研修時間、安全率などの労働力指標を少なくとも3年間維持し、構造"
"的な変化、\n"
"                パフォーマンスの向上、または新たなリスクを特定します。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_e1
msgid ""
"At present, <strong>{{ company_name }}</strong>'s emission strategy "
"prioritises\n"
"                                direct reduction at source (Scopes 1, 2, and "
"3) over offsetting.\n"
"                                Where carbon credits are used, they adhere "
"to recognized standards (<em>\n"
"                                    <strong>e.g., Gold Standard, VCS, CDM</"
"strong>\n"
"                                </em>\n"
"                                )."
msgstr ""
"現在、<strong>{{ company_name }}</strong> の排出戦略では、\n"
"                                オフセットよりも排出源での直接的な削減(スコー"
"プ1、2、3)を優先しています。\n"
"                                カーボンクレジットを使用する場合、それらは認"
"定された基準(<em>\n"
"                                    <strong>例：ゴールドスタンダード、VCS、"
"CDM</strong>\n"
"                                </em>\n"
"                                )に準拠しています。"

