#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_g1
msgid ""
"Explain mitigation measures for late payments or\n"
"                                                unfair\n"
"                                                terms."
msgstr ""
"支払遅延や\n"
"                                                不公正な\n"
"                                                契約条件に対する是正措置を説"
"明してください。"

#. module: esg
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:esg.esg_csrd_knowledge_article_template_csrd_esrs_s1
msgid ""
"Explain the actions taken to address material impacts on\n"
"                                        the workforce,\n"
"                                        including their effectiveness and "
